Easy answer for this one:

1. Turn machine off.
2. Remove Cover to machine, for access to Interface cards.
3. Remove the NIC from the slot.(make sure you use anti-static measures)
4. Move Multi-Pin Jumper Block from one side of two-way pinset to other.
5. Re-Insert Card
6. Replace Cover
7. Hookup to 10Base2 network.
8. Boot machine...

HTH, Course I may be mistaken, but this machine is old enough to need
that.


