(UP1000, for example) on which without RTC you will never get reliable
reads from a system clock.  Sometimes you will get ok readouts and
sometimes totally bogus values.  OTOH with RTC on UX I could not set
a system clock to anything which would look even remotely sane - does
not matter what I tried.  Without RTC there is no problem.  YMMV.

