It is very simple, for every function that it complains about,
type 'man <function name>' like 'man strcmp'.  Sometimes this
gives you the wrong manual section, in which case try
'man 3 <function name>'   At the top of the manual page is a
list of files that must be included for the function to be
prototyped correctly, like '#include <string.h>' in this case.

