In article <I%2O4.163$NX3.3036@typhoon.aracnet.com>, "Zane H. Healy" <healyzh@shell1.aracnet.com> wrote:
> c5141@my-deja.com wrote:
> > I have inherited a DEC 4000 model 620.  I would like to know if anyone
> > has ever successfully installed linux on this machine. I have found
> > many
> > posts on the PCI architecture machines but none on this machine.  Any
> > information would be of great help, and I thank you before hand.
