Using what BLAS routines. Probablky the one from libcxml ;-?
Plain LAPACk with generic BLAS certainly is slower than libcxml, but
LAPACK on top of a fast vendor BLAS quite often is very fast - that
actually one reason for the design ;-)
I have (had ?) some code that worked faster with the generic LAPACK on
top of ATLAS BLAS than with libcxml ;-!
