Take your pick but seeing as power supplies are generally cheaper than
motherboards I would reccomend modifying the power supply. Just scrape some
insulation off the green and one of the black wires and twist them together
so the copper inside touches then wrap up with insulating tape or use an
automotive 'scotchlock' type connector.

