We use 2.2.14 on a DS20 cluster, got the same problem. Up to now only
generic is supported on a DP264 architecture. There is a known bug in
the
nautilus configuration, which you don't need at all. Just change the 
nautilus define in
./include/config/alpha/nautilus.h 
to something like
#undef  CONFIG_ALPHA_NAUTILUS

There are also some patches for that nautilus thing somewhere on the
suse homepage ... under Andrea something 

Robert

